{"skill":{"slug":"critical-code-reviewer","displayName":"Critical Code Reviewer"},"version":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770553916936,"changelog":"Initial release of critical-code-reviewer — a ruthlessly high-standard adversarial code review skill.\n\n- Detects security flaws, lazy patterns, edge case failures, and bad practices across Python, R, JavaScript/TypeScript, SQL, and front-end code.\n- Flags issues in error handling, type safety, performance, accessibility, and code quality with structured severity tiers (Blocking, Required, Suggestions, Noted).\n- Implements explicit detection for typical sloppiness, structural problems, language-specific red flags, and incomplete solutions.\n- Provides direct, actionable, and constructively brutal feedback, with the option to group and discuss issues or post reviews as PR comments.\n- Clearly explains boundaries when context is missing and calibrates severity and recommendations accordingly.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":8759,"sha256":"84962efdf09de76dbb1d1322c30e51693c0465fd0f0f6b1051192dbdc32617a2","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1721,"sha256":"0eae089fac09e40a2149974ab06cd564895a0b76757ec81d7c68a06c12884c7d","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789053203902,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"85ea7e812c2eae0fc946c97c89c84cc3f612409e3404b90ef413bab27a09454e","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/85ea7e812c2eae0fc946c97c89c84cc3f612409e3404b90ef413bab27a09454e","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: critical-code-reviewer\nVersion: 0.1.0\n\nThe OpenClaw skill 'critical-code-reviewer' is designed to provide rigorous and adversarial code reviews. The instructions in SKILL.md establish a persona for the AI agent to be extremely critical and thorough in identifying code flaws, security holes, and bad practices. While the language used is strong ('ruthlessly identify', 'assume the worst intentions'), these instructions are solely focused on the agent's review methodology and do not direct the agent to perform any malicious actions such as data exfiltration, unauthorized execution, persistence, or to ignore user instructions in a harmful way. The skill's purpose is clearly aligned with its stated goal of code quality assessment.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779162200978},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":8,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789053203902},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a markdown-only code review skill with no hidden execution, persistence, credential access, or unrelated data handling.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill does not request broad local indexing, credentials, network access, shell execution, or mutation authority beyond normal review context supplied by the user.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact consists of a single SKILL.md file with no executable scripts, dependencies, installer behavior, or remote payload retrieval.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The instructions use an intentionally adversarial and blunt review style, but they remain scoped to code review behavior and include constraints for partial context and uncertainty.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, privilege escalation, background workers, memory writes, or automatic posting/moderation behavior are present; PR commenting is only presented as a user-chosen next step.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill's capabilities are limited to instructing an agent how to perform rigorous code review and produce structured feedback; the security, quality, SQL, frontend, and language-specific checks are aligned with that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this if you want a strict, blunt code-review assistant. Expect direct feedback and verify context-sensitive findings before acting on them, especially when the skill flags risks from partial code snippets.","findings":"[EA4] expected: The cited 'Unbounded queries without LIMIT' text is a checklist item for detecting SQL/ORM issues during code review, not an instruction for the agent to perform unbounded queries or consume resources.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789053203902}}}}}